{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05239","headline":"秋庭夜月有怀 · 李澄之","name":"秋庭夜月有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游客三江外，单栖百虑违。\n山川忆处近，形影梦中归。\n夜月明虚帐，秋风入捣衣。\n从来不惯别，况属鴈南飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李澄之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}